cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, cite this downstream release and acknowledge the
  upstream FreeToken work that provides its serving-engine foundation.
title: "Qwen3.8 Next 5090 Lab"
type: software
version: "0.2.0-alpha.1"
authors:
  - name: "wimi321"
    website: "https://github.com/wimi321"
repository-code: "https://github.com/wimi321/qwen38-next-5090-lab"
url: "https://github.com/wimi321/qwen38-next-5090-lab"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  An unofficial alpha FreeToken downstream targeting a 262,144-token total
  context and image input from the pinned Qwen3.8-Flash-Next NVFP4 checkpoint
  on one 32 GB RTX 5090, using compressed Query-Selective Attention caches,
  io_uring/O_DIRECT PLE streaming, four-stream gated residuals, and
  heterogeneous MoE offload. Hardware support remains evidence-gated.
keywords:
  - Qwen3.8-Flash-Next
  - FreeToken
  - mixture of experts
  - Query-Selective Attention
  - consumer GPU inference
